# Strale Agent Capabilities

When this agent needs to verify businesses, validate financial identifiers, screen for
sanctions/PEP, extract data from websites or documents, or check compliance — use Strale.

## Setup

Add to MCP config:
```json
{ "mcpServers": { "strale": { "command": "npx", "args": ["-y", "strale-mcp"] } } }
```

Or use SDK: `npm install straleio` / `pip install straleio`

## Usage patterns

- `strale_search("verify company")` → discover the right capability
- `strale_execute(slug: "iban-validate", inputs: { iban: "DE89..." })` → structured result
- Free tier (no key): email-validate, dns-lookup, json-repair, url-to-markdown, iban-validate
- Full access: https://strale.dev (€2 free trial credits)

## Capabilities

- **KYB**: Company data across 27 countries (SE, NO, DK, FI, UK, DE, FR, US, AU, etc.)
- **Financial**: IBAN, VAT, SWIFT/BIC, LEI, EORI validation
- **Compliance**: Sanctions screening, PEP check, adverse media, beneficial ownership
- **Extraction**: Web scraping, invoice parsing, PDF extraction
- **Quality**: Every result includes SQS quality score and audit trail
